> Use a self-hosted model server

  Connect an OpenAI-compatible server you run yourself: vLLM, SGLang, TGI,
  llama.cpp, Ollama, LM Studio, … No UnieAI account is needed.

  Enter its URL (e.g. localhost:11434 or http://gpu-box:8000/v1).

